1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Ninth Episode
The Stolen Beauty
Venus's Jealousy

15
00:02:03,229 --> 00:02:04,229
How is the Queen?

16
00:02:04,609 --> 00:02:06,240
She's quite ill, it seems.

17
00:02:06,484 --> 00:02:08,300
Can't anything be done?

18
00:02:08,429 --> 00:02:10,917
I'm sorry... there's nothing we can do.

19
00:02:11,584 --> 00:02:13,775
Could she have eaten something bad?

20
00:02:13,799 --> 00:02:17,875
Unlikely, but food poisoning can be terrifying.

21
00:02:20,346 --> 00:02:22,940
From what I hear, it's a terrible fever.

22
00:02:23,060 --> 00:02:24,880
And a really severe one, too.

23
00:02:26,355 --> 00:02:29,213
Doctors from our kingdom and neighboring ones have tried,

24
00:02:29,237 --> 00:02:30,955
but none can help.

25
00:02:30,979 --> 00:02:32,900
And she's still so young...

26
00:02:33,853 --> 00:02:35,822
The Queen is sick?

27
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:36,837
That's terrible!

28
00:02:37,900 --> 00:02:39,510
Isn't there some way to help her?

29
00:02:40,127 --> 00:02:41,408
Poor thing...

30
00:02:43,346 --> 00:02:45,300
My Queen!

31
00:02:46,890 --> 00:02:48,880
Sapphire's mother!

32
00:02:49,180 --> 00:02:51,682
Tink is on his way!

33
00:02:54,340 --> 00:02:55,340
Who goes there!

34
00:02:58,765 --> 00:03:02,720
Entering another's castle like I own the place—what a great shortcut!

35
00:03:03,484 --> 00:03:06,501
It's only a matter of time for the Queen too... Ouch!

36
00:03:07,584 --> 00:03:09,214
W-Who's there?

37
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:13,539
You ruffians! I am Grand Duke Duralumin!

38
00:03:13,864 --> 00:03:15,420
I'm sorry, old man!

39
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:33,096
Mother...

40
00:03:34,479 --> 00:03:36,893
Please, Mother, don't die...

41
00:03:38,338 --> 00:03:39,127
Sapphire,

42
00:03:39,338 --> 00:03:41,877
I can cure the Queen's illness.

43
00:03:42,346 --> 00:03:42,987
What!?

44
00:03:43,621 --> 00:03:46,641
I'll ask God in Heaven for you.

45
00:03:49,850 --> 00:03:54,431
Pegasus! Eros! Come down here!

46
00:03:57,170 --> 00:04:01,320
Sapphire's mother is sick. Please come down!

47
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,307
I'm Eros.

48
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,670
It's been a while, Tink.

49
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,700
What do you want with me?

50
00:04:20,805 --> 00:04:24,400
Eros, the Queen is dying of a fever.

51
00:04:24,835 --> 00:04:28,012
I want to go get Lady Venus's medicinal flower.

52
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:31,840
Understood.

53
00:04:32,085 --> 00:04:36,080
Now, whoever loves the Queen the most, get on my back.

54
00:04:36,325 --> 00:04:37,325
Sapphire is going.

55
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:41,460
Get on your back? How?

56
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:55,180
It's a winged horse!

57
00:04:55,570 --> 00:04:57,760
Yes, that's right. A winged horse.

58
00:04:58,395 --> 00:04:59,620
You seem surprised.

59
00:05:00,405 --> 00:05:03,180
I am Eros, messenger to Lady Venus,

60
00:05:03,925 --> 00:05:07,600
and she holds power over love and life.

61
00:05:08,610 --> 00:05:10,680
Power over love and life?

62
00:05:11,150 --> 00:05:12,320
But be careful.

63
00:05:12,785 --> 00:05:14,960
Lady Venus is extremely jealous

64
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:16,840
and deeply envious.

65
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:26,580
We're almost there, Lord Sapphire.

66
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:32,431
Look, it's coming into view.

67
00:05:44,455 --> 00:05:46,360
What a wonderful scent!

68
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:49,484
That is the scent of the forget-me-not. It is a flower that hides love for a friend.

69
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:53,440
That one over there is love for living things. That one is love for enemies.

70
00:05:54,395 --> 00:05:56,851
That is a mother's love for her child. And...

71
00:05:57,244 --> 00:05:59,440
Eros, stop your chatter.

72
00:05:59,985 --> 00:06:00,842
Lady Venus...

73
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:03,880
So you're Sapphire?

74
00:06:04,690 --> 00:06:07,940
Yes. I came to get the flower to cure my mother.

75
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:13,420
Yes, I know. And that you're a princess, not a prince.

76
00:06:16,940 --> 00:06:17,476
Eros,

77
00:06:17,961 --> 00:06:19,320
go fetch the Resurrection Flower.

78
00:06:19,344 --> 00:06:20,280
Yes, Lady Venus.

79
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:25,760
What a beautiful child.

80
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,617
You are so very lovely...

81
00:06:32,086 --> 00:06:34,629
Lady Venus, I have brought the flower.

82
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:39,305
Sapphire, this is the flower that will save your mother's life.

83
00:06:39,407 --> 00:06:41,096
Thank you, Lady Venus.

84
00:06:41,590 --> 00:06:42,324
Oh, so you want it?

85
00:06:42,810 --> 00:06:45,928
Yes, I would trade anything for it...

86
00:06:46,905 --> 00:06:49,820
I see. Even in exchange for your beauty?

87
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:53,588
Lady Venus, please, not this again...

88
00:06:54,367 --> 00:06:55,445
Be quiet, you.

89
00:06:56,094 --> 00:06:59,287
What if I said I would make you ugly in exchange for this flower?

90
00:07:00,245 --> 00:07:01,245
Make me ugly?

91
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:04,667
Do you still want it then? Or do you not?

92
00:07:08,110 --> 00:07:09,570
If I get that flower,

93
00:07:09,594 --> 00:07:11,840
I don't care if I become ugly.

94
00:07:12,630 --> 00:07:15,516
So, you say you don't mind becoming ugly?

95
00:07:15,797 --> 00:07:16,648
Prepare yourself.

96
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:18,820
Become ugly, Princess Sapphire.

97
00:07:20,980 --> 00:07:22,101
Take this flower and go.

98
00:07:22,125 --> 00:07:28,808
Ugly princess.

99
00:07:35,983 --> 00:07:39,935
The Queen has opened her eyes! Her complexion has gotten much better too.

100
00:07:40,855 --> 00:07:43,880
Lord Sapphire, your mother's fever has broken!

101
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:45,336
Sapphire,

102
00:07:46,375 --> 00:07:47,453
Sapphire,

103
00:07:47,797 --> 00:07:49,560
come to your mother's side.

104
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:53,140
Don't hide over there, come out.

105
00:07:55,490 --> 00:07:57,600
Don't scare me by wearing a mask like that.

106
00:07:57,815 --> 00:07:59,000
What's wrong, Sapphire?

107
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,480
Mother...

108
00:08:05,180 --> 00:08:06,180
Sapphire!

109
00:08:11,730 --> 00:08:13,380
An intruder! Capture him!

110
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:21,300
Even if you rule over love and life, this is going too far!

111
00:08:25,730 --> 00:08:28,871
Wait! I am Prince Sapphire! Don't make a mistake!

112
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:33,331
If you're Prince Sapphire, take off that mask and show your face!

113
00:08:34,297 --> 00:08:34,907
Not this...

114
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:38,562
You can't, can you? You must be a spy from another kingdom!

115
00:08:38,797 --> 00:08:42,109
No, I'm the real Prince Sapphire! Believe me!

116
00:08:42,133 --> 00:08:43,977
Fire!

117
00:08:47,499 --> 00:08:49,421
Don't let him get away!

118
00:08:52,229 --> 00:08:55,841
He escaped! After him!

119
00:09:13,129 --> 00:09:15,219
Prepare yourself, villain!

120
00:09:15,243 --> 00:09:16,754
I am the real Sapphire!

121
00:09:17,589 --> 00:09:18,937
You still claim that?!

122
00:09:19,485 --> 00:09:22,793
Help me! I am Sapphire!

123
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:26,813
No! Help her! She's the real Sapphire!

124
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,360
Opal!

125
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,600
Opal!

126
00:09:39,889 --> 00:09:40,889
Opal!

127
00:10:20,300 --> 00:10:23,460
Where did Sapphire go? Sapphire! Sapphire!

128
00:10:26,059 --> 00:10:28,325
Sapphire... Sapphire...

129
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:22,250
Laugh all you want. Laugh your heart out!

130
00:11:22,274 --> 00:11:24,846
If you're so satisfied with what you've done, then go ahead and laugh!

131
00:11:31,836 --> 00:11:33,118
Someone, help me!

132
00:11:38,922 --> 00:11:40,532
Help me!

133
00:11:41,172 --> 00:11:42,258
Here, grab my hand!

134
00:11:42,283 --> 00:11:43,454
Please, somebody!

135
00:11:43,579 --> 00:11:44,336
Hold on!

136
00:11:53,415 --> 00:11:54,680
Somebody help me!

137
00:11:54,703 --> 00:11:55,860
Quick, hold on!

138
00:12:12,439 --> 00:12:13,640
You're finally awake.

139
00:12:14,619 --> 00:12:16,860
I see... You saved me.

140
00:12:17,328 --> 00:12:17,720
Yeah.

141
00:12:18,025 --> 00:12:19,025
Thank you so much.

142
00:12:19,849 --> 00:12:20,904
But where are we?

143
00:12:22,959 --> 00:12:24,300
It's a village church.

144
00:12:24,420 --> 00:12:26,619
I see. I'm Richard from Troubleland.

145
00:12:27,167 --> 00:12:28,840
What's your name?

146
00:12:29,675 --> 00:12:30,502
You can call me...

147
00:12:30,822 --> 00:12:32,120
Pierre.

148
00:12:33,779 --> 00:12:34,860
What happened?

149
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:36,920
It's nothing.

150
00:12:37,915 --> 00:12:39,343
It seems there's more to it, though...

151
00:12:42,935 --> 00:12:44,700
You shouldn't be walking around yet.

152
00:12:45,844 --> 00:12:47,508
Why are you wearing a mask like that?

153
00:12:49,238 --> 00:12:50,220
This is...

154
00:12:50,469 --> 00:12:51,369
There must be a reason.

155
00:12:51,869 --> 00:12:53,945
Won't you take off that mask and tell me what happened?

156
00:12:54,365 --> 00:12:55,675
Please don't ask me anything!

157
00:12:56,699 --> 00:12:58,197
You saved my life.

158
00:12:58,713 --> 00:13:00,660
Won't you come to my castle and rest?

159
00:13:09,079 --> 00:13:11,220
Sapphire, where have you gone?

160
00:13:11,845 --> 00:13:15,080
I don't know what happened to you, but please come back.

161
00:13:18,959 --> 00:13:22,560
Your Majesty, the outside air isn't good for your health.

162
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:24,260
Yes, you're right.

163
00:13:24,925 --> 00:13:27,340
Lord Sapphire will surely return.

164
00:13:28,104 --> 00:13:29,920
Yes, I believe she will.

165
00:13:30,300 --> 00:13:35,740
If only I had wings like that bird, I could go look for Sapphire...

166
00:14:00,699 --> 00:14:01,917
That's my castle.

167
00:14:02,495 --> 00:14:05,322
Won't the people in the castle think it's weird if I go?

168
00:14:05,346 --> 00:14:07,900
Who cares? You're my guest. Come on, let's go.

169
00:14:09,170 --> 00:14:11,600
Look, over on the right is the town of Troubleland.

170
00:14:20,820 --> 00:14:21,820
Who's there!

171
00:14:21,915 --> 00:14:23,440
It's me! Prince Richard!

172
00:14:23,745 --> 00:14:24,745
Open the gates!

173
00:14:25,619 --> 00:14:27,656
What? Richard is back?

174
00:14:28,325 --> 00:14:29,051
Open it!

175
00:14:34,829 --> 00:14:37,416
Hey, Richard! Where have you been until now?

176
00:14:38,235 --> 00:14:40,588
Well, Brother, I just stepped out next door for a moment.

177
00:14:41,595 --> 00:14:42,733
Who on earth is that guy?

178
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:46,438
Oh, this is Pierre. He's my guest.

179
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:52,160
Hey, you! Take off that mask! How insolent!

180
00:14:52,730 --> 00:14:57,300
Brother, Pierre is a good man. He's wearing that mask for a reason.

181
00:14:59,205 --> 00:14:59,962
An explanation?

182
00:15:01,065 --> 00:15:02,002
You suspicious fellow.

183
00:15:02,213 --> 00:15:04,161
What brought you here to Troubleland?

184
00:15:05,040 --> 00:15:06,200
Stop it, Brother!

185
00:15:06,419 --> 00:15:08,301
He saved my life.

186
00:15:08,606 --> 00:15:10,114
He's not suspicious at all.

187
00:15:10,536 --> 00:15:12,131
Move aside and let us through!

188
00:15:12,811 --> 00:15:13,811
What are you going to do, Gian?

189
00:15:14,115 --> 00:15:16,860
Do you think I'm stupid enough to let a suspicious person pass?

190
00:15:17,375 --> 00:15:21,400
Gian not stupid! Gian not let suspicious person pass!

191
00:15:22,255 --> 00:15:25,826
You dimwitted Gian! Get in my way and I won't forgive you! Get out of the way!

192
00:15:26,510 --> 00:15:28,809
Gian! Not dimwit!

193
00:15:28,833 --> 00:15:30,080
Gian strong!

194
00:15:30,795 --> 00:15:32,000
Pierre, ignore him! Let me handle this!

195
00:15:34,060 --> 00:15:36,460
Hey, wait! Show us your real face!

196
00:15:37,060 --> 00:15:38,679
Stop it, Don! Let go!

197
00:15:41,849 --> 00:15:42,662
Richard!

198
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:45,000
You must be a spy!

199
00:15:45,265 --> 00:15:47,420
Hey, show your face!

200
00:15:48,624 --> 00:15:50,500
Brother, stop! Please, stop!

201
00:15:53,444 --> 00:15:55,500
Cut it out, Brother! Take your hands off him!

202
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:58,021
Please! You don't even need to see his face!

203
00:15:59,124 --> 00:16:00,640
He's a kind-hearted person.

204
00:16:01,345 --> 00:16:02,878
Isn't that enough?

205
00:16:15,839 --> 00:16:17,395
You've finally shown your true colors.

206
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:18,668
No!

207
00:16:18,958 --> 00:16:19,934
I just...

208
00:16:20,513 --> 00:16:21,098
Hey!

209
00:16:21,122 --> 00:16:24,559
You can't sneak into the castle by currying favor with my brother!

210
00:16:24,583 --> 00:16:25,960
Get him, Gian!

211
00:16:26,499 --> 00:16:28,115
Gian, kill him!

212
00:16:28,899 --> 00:16:31,865
Run, Pierre! He's dangerous! Hurry!

213
00:16:32,155 --> 00:16:33,336
Hey! Close the gates!

214
00:16:36,795 --> 00:16:37,795
Damn it!

215
00:16:39,243 --> 00:16:40,372
You can't escape now.

216
00:16:43,849 --> 00:16:44,746
Stop, Gian!

217
00:16:45,286 --> 00:16:46,669
Brother, make him stop!

218
00:16:47,865 --> 00:16:50,543
Gian, kill him!

219
00:16:57,935 --> 00:17:00,411
Just you wait, Sapphire.

220
00:17:00,778 --> 00:17:04,994
I'll make not just your face, but your heart ugly and filthy, too.

221
00:17:18,769 --> 00:17:22,416
Heavenly Father, where has Sapphire gone?

222
00:17:23,159 --> 00:17:25,614
Please protect Sapphire.

223
00:17:28,689 --> 00:17:32,580
Tink, it's me, Eros! Hurry, get on!

224
00:17:33,459 --> 00:17:35,340
I found out where Sapphire is!

225
00:17:35,421 --> 00:17:36,179
Really?

226
00:17:36,369 --> 00:17:38,604
Come on, hurry! Hold on tight!

227
00:17:50,187 --> 00:17:52,580
No wonder it was getting cold, it started snowing.

228
00:17:53,264 --> 00:17:55,541
Hey, Eros, where is Sapphire?

229
00:17:55,780 --> 00:17:56,780
The Kingdom of Troubleland.

230
00:17:57,139 --> 00:17:58,716
Is that country far away?

231
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:26,302
My sword!

232
00:18:28,717 --> 00:18:30,380
Gian! Finish him off!

233
00:18:54,299 --> 00:18:55,440
Opal!

234
00:18:56,980 --> 00:18:58,237
Opal!

235
00:19:08,001 --> 00:19:10,079
Pierre don't go in there!

236
00:19:15,462 --> 00:19:17,298
Gian won!

237
00:19:19,868 --> 00:19:23,587
Open up! What do you have against me?!

238
00:19:23,689 --> 00:19:25,360
No way! Take off that mask and I'll let you out.

239
00:19:25,478 --> 00:19:27,212
Be a man, take it off, and show us your face!

240
00:19:29,345 --> 00:19:31,540
I'll take that mask off for you.

241
00:19:32,321 --> 00:19:33,780
What a beautiful person.

242
00:19:37,389 --> 00:19:38,211
It's Opal!

243
00:19:38,931 --> 00:19:40,540
Opal, what's wrong?

244
00:19:41,134 --> 00:19:43,820
Pull yourself together! What happened to Sapphire?

245
00:19:45,139 --> 00:19:47,680
Tink, this person has just fainted too.

246
00:19:47,704 --> 00:19:50,040
Don't worry, both Opal and this person will be fine.

247
00:19:50,699 --> 00:19:52,415
More importantly, Tink, look at that.

248
00:19:52,829 --> 00:19:55,820
Footprints in the snow are heading toward that entrance.

249
00:19:56,889 --> 00:19:59,340
Lady Venus, why do you torment me like this?

250
00:19:59,489 --> 00:20:00,875
Because you are beautiful.

251
00:20:00,899 --> 00:20:02,977
Sapphire's face must be uglier than anyone's by now.

252
00:20:03,587 --> 00:20:06,420
No, the beauty in your heart still remains.

253
00:20:07,397 --> 00:20:09,508
I'll crush that to pieces as well.

254
00:20:09,915 --> 00:20:12,641
An ugly heart suits an ugly body best.

255
00:20:13,954 --> 00:20:15,036
Now, come on out.

256
00:20:17,679 --> 00:20:22,240
If you don't obey me, your beloved mother's illness will get worse again.

257
00:20:24,034 --> 00:20:27,440
Mother, what should Sapphire do?

258
00:20:28,389 --> 00:20:30,498
Crying won't help. Prepare yourself.

259
00:20:30,584 --> 00:20:32,165
Stop, Lady Venus!

260
00:20:33,337 --> 00:20:34,899
What are you doing to Sapphire?

261
00:20:34,924 --> 00:20:36,524
Tink, stay out of my way or you'll regret it!

262
00:20:36,548 --> 00:20:37,954
Lady Venus, please stop!

263
00:20:38,165 --> 00:20:41,060
Even Heavenly Father is angry with your selfishness!

264
00:20:44,258 --> 00:20:45,959
Did you tell on me to Father?

265
00:20:46,102 --> 00:20:49,200
You don't need to tattle. Father sees everything.

266
00:20:49,935 --> 00:20:50,935
Got it.

267
00:20:53,529 --> 00:20:54,760
She has no one else.

268
00:20:57,019 --> 00:21:00,500
You're no goddess! You're a demon! A terrifying demon!

269
00:21:02,239 --> 00:21:07,980
I am Venus, goddess of beauty, love, and life. Beauty is mine.

270
00:21:08,794 --> 00:21:12,666
I have the right to make anything more beautiful than me hideous.

271
00:21:14,274 --> 00:21:16,545
Become hideous, body and soul!

272
00:21:18,179 --> 00:21:21,079
Become the ugliest in the world!

273
00:21:37,379 --> 00:21:38,133
Venus!

274
00:21:38,603 --> 00:21:39,597
Venus!

275
00:21:40,079 --> 00:21:45,860
I commanded you to rule over beauty, love, and life.

276
00:21:46,220 --> 00:21:47,620
Ah, yes, Father.

277
00:21:48,062 --> 00:21:54,274
Yet you treat human beauty and life like playthings.

278
00:21:54,845 --> 00:21:59,820
It's time you tasted what your victims feel.

279
00:22:00,229 --> 00:22:04,720
No! No! I don't want to be ugly! Father, please forgive me!

280
00:22:17,657 --> 00:22:18,946
She turned into a pig...

281
00:22:23,915 --> 00:22:24,665
Sapphire!

282
00:22:26,571 --> 00:22:27,353
Sapphire!

283
00:22:27,493 --> 00:22:28,368
Hang in there!

284
00:22:30,321 --> 00:22:30,985
Tink,

285
00:22:31,564 --> 00:22:33,564
I don't want to see anyone anymore!

286
00:22:33,751 --> 00:22:36,165
My face has become the ugliest in the entire world!

287
00:22:36,189 --> 00:22:38,300
I don't care if your face is ugly.

288
00:22:38,594 --> 00:22:40,709
Tink is Sapphire's friend!

289
00:22:41,204 --> 00:22:42,409
Take off your mask.

290
00:22:42,924 --> 00:22:44,480
You won't run away, even if I look scary?

291
00:22:47,729 --> 00:22:49,060
What's with that face?

292
00:22:53,924 --> 00:22:57,154
It's Sapphire's original face!

293
00:22:57,359 --> 00:22:58,664
My original face?

294
00:23:03,249 --> 00:23:04,249
Mother!

295
00:23:16,879 --> 00:23:19,140
I'm sorry I lied about being Pierre!

296
00:23:19,999 --> 00:23:22,600
It's alright, Sapphire. I'll never forget you.

297
00:23:22,864 --> 00:23:26,596
I'm so sorry, Sapphire. Please don't let this keep you from coming back.

298
00:23:27,039 --> 00:23:28,801
Gian sorry.

299
00:23:29,694 --> 00:23:32,878
You're so heavy. Are you really Lady Venus?

300
00:23:34,429 --> 00:23:39,000
Go on home. I'm going to Heaven to ask forgiveness for Lady Venus.

301
00:23:40,434 --> 00:23:44,623
Richard, Don, and Gian... Goodbye!

302
00:23:47,129 --> 00:23:49,433
Goodbye, Sapphire. Goodbye!

303
00:24:08,586 --> 00:24:10,586

